title: The Cabinet
subtitle: Change the policies and the politics of the government.
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/cards/cabinet.svg?v=2
tags: advisor
new-page: true
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0) or lsr_in_gov = 1

= The Cabinet

[? if in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0 : The party shares the government, and with it the power to set the country's course. ?][? if lsr_in_gov = 1 and bol_regime = 1 : The party holds a few commissariats in a government that is not its own: the land and the courts are in its hands, and not much else. ?] A change of course takes a turn, and the cabinet cannot change course again for two months. Policies have a lasting effect, month by month.

Land: [+ pol_land : pol_land +]. [? if in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0 : Food: [+ pol_food : pol_food +]. Labour: [+ pol_labour : pol_labour +]. ?][? if at_war = 1 and in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0 : The war: [+ pol_war : pol_war +]. ?]Order: [+ pol_order : pol_order +].

- @land_0: Leave the land to the Assembly.
- @land_1: Let the land committees regulate the transfers of land.
- @land_2: Socialise the land now, by decree.
- @food_0: Leave the grain trade to the market.
- @food_1: Enforce the grain monopoly and fixed prices.
- @food_2: Send detachments to requisition grain.
- @war_0: Fight a defensive war.
- @war_1: Press for a general peace: Stockholm and the neutrals.
- @war_2: Prepare an offensive with the Allies.
- @order_0: Govern by the ordinary law.
- @order_1: Introduce emergency measures against disorder.
- @order_2: Proclaim broad liberties and an amnesty.
- @labour_0: Leave industry to the employers.
- @labour_1: Guarantee the eight-hour day and the factory committees.
- @labour_2: Regulate industry through the state.
- @kadets_in: Invite the Kadets back into the government.
- @kadets_out: Dismiss the Kadet ministers and govern with the Soviet parties alone.
- @root: Return to main

@land_0
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 or lsr_in_gov = 1) and pol_land != 0
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_land = 0;
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: 2, rel_kad: 2});
!}

The land question is left to the Constituent Assembly, as the liberals ask. The peasants are told to be patient.

- @root: Continue.

@land_1
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 or lsr_in_gov = 1) and pol_land != 1
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_land = 1;
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -4, rel_kad: -3, right_threat: 1}); RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 2}); Q.land_committees = (Q.land_committees || 0) + 1;
!}

The land committees now have the government's authority to regulate the transfers until the Assembly meets.

- @root: Continue.

@land_2
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 or lsr_in_gov = 1) and pol_land != 2
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0 and (rel_ally >= 50 or player_party = 'sr' or player_party = 'lsr')
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?][? if not (rel_ally >= 50 or player_party = 'sr' or player_party = 'lsr') : The party that holds the peasants does not agree. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_land = 2;
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -8, rel_kad: -8, right_threat: 3}); RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 4}); RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 6); Q.land_committees = (Q.land_committees || 0) + 1;
!}

A decree abolished private ownership of land, and put it in the hands of the village communities. The landowners, and everyone who sits on their boards, are in uproar.

- @root: Continue.

@food_0
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0) and pol_food != 0
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_food = 0;
RO.add(Q, {bread: -2, ruble: 1}); RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 1, workers: -1});
!}

The grain trade is left to merchants and cooperatives. Grain appears at higher prices, and the bread queues are longer.

- @root: Continue.

@food_1
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0) and pol_food != 1
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_food = 1;
RO.add(Q, {bread: 3}); RO.boost(Q, {peasants: -2});
!}

The grain monopoly and the fixed prices are enforced. The cities eat a little better; the villages sell a little less.

- @root: Continue.

@food_2
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0) and pol_food != 2
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_food = 2;
RO.add(Q, {bread: 5, repression: 1, soviet_democracy: -1}); RO.boost(Q, {peasants: -6});
!}

Armed food detachments leave for the grain provinces. They bring back grain, and the villages will not forget how.

- @root: Continue.

@war_0
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0 and at_war = 1) and pol_war != 0
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_war = 0;
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 1});
!}

The government will defend the front but not attack. It is the middle line that satisfies nobody for long.

- @root: Continue.

@war_1
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0 and at_war = 1) and pol_war != 1
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_war = 1;
RO.add(Q, {war_weariness: -3, rel_kad: -3}); Q.stockholm = (Q.stockholm || 0) + 1;
!}

The government's diplomacy now aims at a general peace without annexations. The Allied ambassadors have asked for explanations.

- @root: Continue.

@war_2
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0 and at_war = 1) and pol_war != 2
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_war = 2;
RO.add(Q, {war_weariness: 3, army_discipline: 3, rel_kad: 3}); Q.offensive_prepared = 1;
!}

The army is told to prepare to attack. The Allies are pleased; the soldiers are not.

- @root: Continue.

@order_0
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 or lsr_in_gov = 1) and pol_order != 0
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_order = 0;
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 0});
!}

The government will govern by the ordinary law and the courts, with the liberties of February.

- @root: Continue.

@order_1
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 or lsr_in_gov = 1) and pol_order != 1
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_order = 1;
RO.add(Q, {right_threat: -3, repression: 2, soviet_democracy: -2, rel_kad: 2});
!}

Emergency measures give the government the right to arrest agitators and close newspapers. The generals are reassured; the soviets are not.

- @root: Continue.

@order_2
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 or lsr_in_gov = 1) and pol_order != 2
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_order = 2;
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 3, rel_bol: 4, right_threat: 2});
!}

An amnesty empties the prisons of those held for political offences, and the press is freed of all censorship. Every party, including the ones that would abolish them, is grateful.

- @root: Continue.

@labour_0
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0) and pol_labour != 0
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_labour = 0;
RO.add(Q, {ruble: 1}); RO.boost(Q, {workers: -2});
!}

The factories are left to their owners and managers. Production recovers a little, and the workers take notice.

- @root: Continue.

@labour_1
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0) and pol_labour != 1
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_labour = 1;
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 4}); RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -3, ruble: -2});
!}

The eight-hour day and the factory committees are written into law. The workers cheer; the employers threaten to close their plants.

- @root: Continue.

@labour_2
view-if: (in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0) and pol_labour != 2
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cabinet_timer > 0 : The cabinet has changed course too recently. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.pol_labour = 2;
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2}); RO.add(Q, {ruble: 1, rel_kad: -4});
!}

A committee of the state now regulates prices, wages and supplies in the war industries. It is a first step, which the liberals do not like.

- @root: Continue.

@kadets_in
view-if: in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0 and gov_kadets = 0 and rel_kad >= 25
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: The cabinet has changed course too recently.
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.gov_kadets = 1; Q.homogeneous_gov = 0; RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 10, right_threat: -4}); RO.boost(Q, {middle: 3}); RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 8);
!}

The Kadets are back in the cabinet, with the ministries that they had before. The generals and the factory owners are reassured, and the left is not.

- @root: Continue.

@kadets_out
view-if: in_coalition = 1 and bol_regime = 0 and gov_kadets = 1 and rel_ally >= 55
choose-if: cabinet_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: The cabinet has changed course too recently.
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.cabinet_timer = 2;
Q.gov_kadets = 0; Q.homogeneous_gov = 1; RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -12, right_threat: 5, soviet_democracy: 2}); RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2, middle: -3}); RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 8);
!}

The Kadet ministers have been dismissed. The cabinet is now a cabinet of the Soviet parties alone, with nobody to blame.

- @root: Continue.
